agents.prompt:
Analyze the specification structure:
Versions: {{spec-reader.versions}}
ADRs: {{spec-reader.adrs}}
Gaps: {{spec-reader.known_gaps}}

For {{focus_version}} and all subsequent versions, identify:
1. Dependencies: which versions/ADRs must complete first?
2. Prerequisites: technical foundations required?
3. Complexity per phase (low/medium/high)
4. Critical path (longest chain of dependent tasks)
5. Estimated sessions per phase (1 session = 4h)

Return JSON:
{
  "phases": [
    {
      "version": "v0.X.Y",
      "name": "phase name",
      "description": "...",
      "prerequisites": ["v0.X.Y", "ADR-NN"],
      "complexity": "low|medium|high",
      "estimated_sessions": N,
      "critical_path": ["task1", "task2"]
    }
  ]
}
